WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.250
The profile ships its validation tests as
copy-paste Microsoft Graph PowerShell.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.297
Run them in a test tenant with a test
partner tenant first; they were checked

3
00:00:09.297 --> 00:00:13.475
against the Graph PowerShell reference
but haven't been run against a tenant.

4
00:00:13.475 --> 00:00:17.087
Test zero confirms the tenant
ID resolves to the partner

5
00:00:17.087 --> 00:00:20.775
and that the trust and redemption
values match the record.

6
00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:25.383
Test one creates a guest through an
access package request, and checks

7
00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:30.150
the user type is guest and that My
Access still loads under the MFA policy.

8
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.887
Test two finds any partner
account that isn't a guest.

9
00:00:33.887 --> 00:00:38.073
Three is emergency suspension,
four removes the assignment,

10
00:00:38.073 --> 00:00:41.671
five finds duplicates and
unredeemed invitations,

11
00:00:41.671 --> 00:00:46.776
six proves denial for a user with no
assignment and for an unlisted tenant,

12
00:00:46.776 --> 00:00:50.710
seven shows the MFA policy
applied, eight covers devices,

13
00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:53.388
nine rolls back, and ten is partner exit.

14
00:00:53.388 --> 00:00:59.570
Tests one, three, four, nine and ten
write, and each says how to undo it.
